WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Ed answers Ryu’s incoming Drive Impact.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.050
Ed’s DI wins as a Punish Counter.

3
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:05.250
Standing heavy kick picks up the crumpled Ryu.

4
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.450
Heavy Psycho Blitz converts the target combo.

5
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:07.050
Ryu falls at the end of the counter-DI route.
